host/zmk_tables.py is generated from ZMK (https://github.com/zmkfirmware/zmk) by
host/zmk_tables_gen.py: the keycode, modifier and pointing names of
app/include/dt-bindings/zmk/*.h, the built-in behaviours of app/dts/behaviors/*.dtsi, and the
property defaults of app/dts/bindings/behaviors/*.yaml, app/src/behaviors/*.c and app/Kconfig.
The firmware conformance vectors in hud/tests/fixtures/zmk_vectors.json are transcribed from
ZMK's app/tests. The commit they come from is recorded in host/zmk_tables.py (ZMK_COMMIT).
